<title>USA: Dotronix names Erling Anderson CFO.</title>
<headline>Dotronix names Erling Anderson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dotronix Inc, a high resolution video display manufacturer, said Wednesday that Erling Anderson has been named chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Anderson replaces Dave Beel, who left the company, Dotronix said.</p>
<p>Anderson was most recently director of financial plans and controls for U.S. operations of Computing Devices International, a division of Ceridian Corp.</p>
<p>Dotronix shares were up 1/32 at 1-1/16 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
